    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set in the beautiful countryside of Donore, just outside Drogheda, this charming 100-year-old cottage is a truly special home where timeless character meets modern comfort. Thoughtfully upgraded over the years, ‘’Mullaghcrone Lodge’’ has been enhanced for modern-day performance while retaining the charm, warmth and character of its original features. The attention to detail throughout has been both considered and tasteful, creating a home that feels authentic yet beautifully comfortable. Surrounded by mature, landscaped gardens, the property enjoys an exceptional level of privacy and tranquillity. Secure electric front gates and a comprehensive alarm & camera system provide added peace of mind. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a character-filled home in a wonderful countryside setting, offering privacy, charm and modern living just moments from Drogheda. The property is conveniently located within 5 minute’s drive of the M1 motorway junction giving easy access to the M1 Dublin - Belfast Corridor while also benefiting from daily bus service to and from Drogheda Town Centre. Viewing is highly advised to truly appreciated this home.\r\nAMV €595,000 – For Sale by Private Treaty"
      },
      {
