        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nDrawing/Sitting Room\t(5.60m x 3.63m) \r\nKitchen\t\t(5.60m x 3.30m)\r\nLiving / Dining\t\t(3.50m x 5.60m)\r\nBathroom\t\t(3.70m x 2.60m)\r\nUtility Room\t\t(3.70m x 1.70m)\r\nBedroom 1\t\t(5.00m x 5.00m) \r\nEn Suite\t\t(2.66m x 1.47m)\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(3.92m x 3.67m)\r\nBedroom 3 \t\t(4.10m x 3.86m)"
      },
      {
