        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Detached Property \r\nExtends to c. 172 sq.m. (1,851 sq. ft.) \r\nC. 1 Acre Site\r\nOriginally Built C. 1925\r\nFully Refurbished C. 22 Years ago\r\nExtended in C. 2008\r\nO-F-C-H – High Efficiency Boiler\r\nOpen Fire – Cast Iron Fireplace\r\nDouble Glazing Throughout\r\nSash Windows to Original Cottage\r\nFully Fenced & Secure Boundary\r\nWater  - Mains Supply\r\nWaste – Mains Connection\r\nWooden Garden Shed\r\nFully Alarmed & Camera System\r\nMatured Landscaped Gardens\r\nElectric Security Front Gates\r\nAmple Parking \r\nSone & Tarmac Driveway"
